sequenceDiagram
    participant Producer as Producer Client
    participant Redis as Redis/Valkey<br/>6379/TCP RESP<br/>Optional TLS
    participant AP as Async Processor
    participant Gate as Dispatch Gate<br/>(in-process)
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>HTTP PromQL
    participant IGW as Inference Gateway<br/>(llm-d-router)<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant OTel as OTel Collector<br/>4317/TCP gRPC

    Note over Producer, IGW: Flow 1: Redis Sorted Set Mode

    Producer->>Redis: ZADD (priority score)<br/>RESP, Optional TLS, Redis Auth
    AP->>Redis: ZPOPMIN (dequeue)<br/>RESP, Optional TLS, Redis Auth
    Redis-->>AP: Request message

    AP->>Gate: Check dispatch budget
    Gate->>Prom: PromQL: pool saturation /<br/>flow control queue size
    Prom-->>Gate: Metric value [0.0-1.0]
    Gate->>Redis: GET budget key (optional)
    Redis-->>Gate: Budget value
    Gate-->>AP: Budget decision (admit/defer/refuse)

    AP->>OTel: Trace span start<br/>OTLP gRPC, W3C context
    AP->>IGW: HTTP POST inference request<br/>Optional TLS/mTLS
    IGW-->>AP: HTTP response (200/429/5xx)
    AP->>OTel: Trace span end

    alt Success (2xx)
        AP->>Redis: LPUSH result<br/>RESP, Optional TLS, Redis Auth
        Producer->>Redis: BRPOP result<br/>RESP, Optional TLS, Redis Auth
        Redis-->>Producer: Inference result
    else Retryable Error (429/5xx)
        Note over AP, Redis: Flow 3: Retry with Backoff
        AP->>AP: Retry channel (in-process)<br/>Exponential backoff + jitter
        AP->>Redis: ZADD retry queue<br/>(backoff score)
        Note over AP: Re-dequeue when due
    else Non-retryable Error
        AP->>Redis: LPUSH error result
    end

    Note over Producer, IGW: Flow 2: GCP Pub/Sub Mode

    participant GCP as GCP Pub/Sub<br/>443/TCP gRPC<br/>TLS 1.2+
    participant GCPMon as GCP Cloud Monitoring<br/>443/TCP gRPC

    Producer->>GCP: Publish(topic)<br/>gRPC, TLS 1.2+, GCP IAM
    AP->>GCP: Subscribe(subscription)<br/>gRPC, TLS 1.2+, GCP IAM
    GCP-->>AP: Request message

    AP->>Gate: Check dispatch budget
    Gate->>GCPMon: ListTimeSeries<br/>(num_undelivered_messages)
    GCPMon-->>Gate: Backlog metric
    Gate-->>AP: Budget decision

    AP->>IGW: HTTP POST inference request<br/>Optional TLS/mTLS
    IGW-->>AP: HTTP response

    AP->>GCP: Publish(result-topic)<br/>gRPC, TLS 1.2+, GCP IAM
